---
import SiteLayout from '../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site.mjs';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy and enquiries | AdSquirrel" description="How this AdSquirrel website handles your contact enquiry and location or industry preferences." canonical={`${SITE.url}/privacy/`}>
  <main id="main" class="directory-page"><div class="directory-intro"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p><h1>A clear<br /><em>conversation.</em></h1><p>Here is how the current website handles your enquiry and browsing preferences.</p></div>
  <section class="directory-group"><h2>When you contact us</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a WhatsApp message using the information you enter. It opens WhatsApp so you can review and send it. Filling in the form alone does not send an enquiry to us. You can also contact us by email or telephone.</p><p>If you send us an enquiry, we use the information you provide to respond, discuss your requirements and follow up on the conversation. Please avoid including sensitive personal information that is not needed for your enquiry.</p></section>
  <section class="directory-group"><h2>Location and industry</h2><p>Location and industry selections help show relevant content. A location in the page address or an explicit selection does not mean that we know your precise location. The website does not silently request your device location or claim to know the search terms you used.</p></section>
  {import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID && <section class="directory-group"><h2>Analytics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics to understand which pages are useful and which enquiry options people choose, such as calling, emailing or opening WhatsApp. Google Analytics uses cookies and processes information such as pages visited, approximate location and device type under Google’s privacy policy. It does not receive the contents of your enquiry. You can block analytics with your browser’s privacy settings or the Google Analytics opt-out add-on.</p></section>}
  <section class="directory-group"><h2>External services</h2><p>WhatsApp, email providers, map services and social platforms process information under their own privacy policies when you choose to use them. Hosting services may process technical request information to deliver and protect the website.</p></section>
  <section class="directory-group"><h2>Questions or requests</h2><p>For questions about an enquiry or information you have shared, <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>email AdSquirrel</a>.</p></section></main>
</SiteLayout>
